---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<!-- Insert Prompt Uploader のプライバシーポリシー。Google API Services User Data Policy（Limited Use を含む）の開示要件に沿って、Google ユーザーデータの扱いを記載する -->
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Insert Prompt Uploader"
  description="Insert Prompt Uploader のプライバシーポリシー"
  noindex={true}
>
  <main>
    <h1>Privacy Policy — Insert Prompt Uploader</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 2026-10-26</p>

    <h2>Who uses this app</h2>
    <p>
      Insert Prompt Uploader is used only by the owner of the YouTube channel
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@insertprompt">Insert Prompt (@insertprompt)</a>, with the owner's own Google
      account. It has no other users.
    </p>

    <h2>Google user data the app accesses</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>YouTube channel and video data of the owner's own channel (videos, metadata, thumbnails, publishing schedule, playlists).</li>
      <li>View counts and YouTube Analytics reports for the owner's own videos.</li>
      <li>Comments on the owner's own videos, and the owner's replies.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How the data is used</h2>
    <p>
      Only to upload and manage the owner's own videos, schedule their publication, reply to comments as the owner, and
      measure how the owner's videos perform. The data is not used for advertising, not sold, and not used to train
      general AI models.
    </p>

    <h2>Storage and sharing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>OAuth tokens are stored only on the owner's computer, in a private file outside any code repository.</li>
      <li>View counts of the owner's videos are kept on the owner's computer for the owner's own analysis.</li>
      <li>No Google user data is shared with, transferred to, or disclosed to any third party.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The app's use and transfer of information received from Google APIs adheres to the
      <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>,
      including the Limited Use requirements.
    </p>

    <h2>Revoking access</h2>
    <p>
      Access can be revoked at any time at
      <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">Google Account → Third-party connections</a>. Locally stored
      tokens are then deleted by the owner.
    </p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      szkyudi.com uses Google Tag Manager to measure page views. That measurement is unrelated to the app and does not
      involve any data obtained through Google APIs.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="https://x.com/szkyudi">@szkyudi on X</a>.</p>

    <h2 lang="ja">日本語（要約）</h2>
    <p lang="ja">
      本ツールはチャンネル所有者本人だけが使います。取得する Google ユーザーデータは所有者自身のチャンネル・動画・統計・コメントに限られ、動画の管理と公開予約、所有者としての返信、再生数の分析にだけ使います。
      認証情報とデータは所有者のパソコンにのみ保存し、第三者への提供・販売・広告利用は行いません。アクセス権は Google アカウントの「サードパーティ接続」からいつでも取り消せます。
    </p>
    <p><a href="/insert-prompt">Insert Prompt Uploader</a></p>
  </main>
</Layout>

